Welcome to Graco Home Tools, home improvement experts for over 25 years, with more than 150,000 home improvement stories and thousands of videos. Use Graco products to tackle your next do-it-yourself project.
Home Tools for your do-it-you self projects, home projects, and gardening. Graco Home Tools, a leading manufacturer, is dedicated to providing innovative lawn care, home improvement, household cleaning and personal care products for consumers. Graco has more than 170 years in the industry and is a leader in the development and application of its HVLP (high velocity low pressure) paint sprayer technologies. The Graco brand includes a broad lineup of HVLP and centrifugal air powered equipment with an emphasis on reliable and reliable quality. In 2007, the Graco Paint Sprayer Division was acquired, bringing the company’s HVLP line under its brand name. HVLP technology helps give you clean, smooth, efficient, paint and can make your work fast and fun.
